<title>USA: Fonda-Fultonville CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Fonda-Fultonville CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc. said it won $1.821 million of Fonda-Fultonville CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997.</p>
